# R8 9.6.0-alpha06 can relocate a Kotlin text facade subclass outside the
# package of its package-private superclass, crashing WorkManager at startup.
# Preserve only the package names; shrinking, optimization and class renaming remain enabled.
-keeppackagenames kotlin.text.**

